{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:40902ad21bddf226d9f1293b91fa841573893c4d31f3001c4b9e86c5c3b59108",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a87f4805d3e089993267e5350009f9abbfe14be66640c1dd0f6ba485ee0a383",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー……\n能听见我的声音吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53b845a3228cb5e3d4b3f47e1822f03d5233eb89b05b4fd7ee50a4016d45e4d3",
      "text": "对不起……我现在在外面……周围\n可能有点吵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6c851e5f1c641f6e43258f019551d810c04506adb6fab4c94eb3bee7c31d1ad",
      "text": "刚才还在社团活动……\n游乐园的伴手礼，我已经带给大家了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9fb843d12aec10f9d14304189fe43cbd11a41aaa25bdfeb5004624fab2b1ba5",
      "text": "悠介也帮忙拍了……好多照片。\n拿给他们看之后，大家都说看起来很开心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5bf53904030d66017bc84f96ef5c4e79fa3623cece5648982bfd2035b07eb73",
      "text": "大家都玩得\n很开心呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:287d2d13164d40a415dcbc39f3f3115649b6a621861d6e479d830328cd4d20fe",
      "text": "还想再去\n游乐园呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:085e2345aeffa704948e6439aabd8bc7965394ca9982ad4261e06830af4fa59b",
      "text": "嗯，是啊。\n虽然是工作，但也是让人难忘的一天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fbf259c0bd6720dc7f59db7db13aaca189a724229c893ec540d472251734e99",
      "text": "嗯，真的呢……就算不是工作，\n大家一起去玩的话，肯定也会很开心吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e21927c529299a6690cc5e364b62ea50ee8900de612f30fbd21143397fc7db4e",
      "text": "夜晚的舞台还有服装……\n那种暗黑童话的世界观，很帅气对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:199c6926ec21601f49a39c9a824f0d9e3ab2d912d5dfc5860cefac99be7a306b",
      "text": "我觉得我也拿出了……属于我自己的好表现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0584550ea056a726fe7d0abbac230dc86458ca89dba865c798fc08cc03d87266",
      "text": "大家说好下次在High×Joker全员一起\n看当时的演唱会录像……虽然有点不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000033:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64842bff236c88e1d8b0028dad6a9569e7fa2a64d6199fe48431a802ffe481cb",
      "text": "大家一定\n会夸奖你的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8992c5a79d1f67ae567c212f27a4ea07b47c530d411ef4f210e9282f83a7ad10",
      "text": "呵呵……因为大家都很温柔。\n我也想看悠介他们的表演……很期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_401_2_4_022_01_09_a:2_4_022_01_09_a:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2d787cb7f8ae2e15df6a88603f636e69953695f6470c2970c6f6593e2008dd5",
      "text": "听我说了这么多……谢谢你。\n今后我也会加油的……那我再打给你哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
